Changes made: a 9-row excerpt (three participating labs) was derived from the relational
openBIS SQLite export by denormalizing material/print/test views and aggregating per-specimen
flexural results into mean / standard-deviation / n, then mapping the RILEM U/V/W orientation
onto the Open3DCP X/Y/Z/CAST convention. Underlying values are unchanged; the source database
is not redistributed (download it from the DOI). See SOURCE.md and build/extract.py.

